# --- LLaMA (CPU build — SSE4.2 ONLY, NO AVX) ---
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT install from the pre-built wheel index.
# Those wheels are compiled for AVX2. Celeron N4020 only has SSE4.2.
# Running an AVX2 binary on SSE4.2 = illegal instruction crash.
#
# Compiled in a separate Docker stage (see Dockerfile llama-builder).
# This line is here only to track the version — Docker handles the build.

# --- Build (needed at image build time only, NOT runtime) ---
# maturin is intentionally excluded — it lives in the builder Docker stage only

# --- Test (move to requirements-dev.txt when you have time) ---
pytest
pytest-asyncio
pytest-timeout
